Changes in time:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

0.06 -> 0.07:

	- Little improvement on 12fps mode routines.
	- Added Covox support.
	- Added loop option.	    
	- Added end and abort messages. 

0.05b -> 0.06:

	- Added support for 12fps EVAS.
	- Added synchronization with PCM in MSX TurboR.
	- Added options in command line.
	- Added (again) synchronization with the retrace in CHS HD.
	  It can be disable in command line.
	- Program used with several MSX and HDs with success.

0.04b -> 0.05b:

	- Improved playback routines.
	- Removed the check of the file lenght.

0.03b -> 0.04b:

	- Fixed a bug when playing twice the same EVA.
	- Player doesn't need new Bios version from IDE because player
	  does't use the Bios. (No tested with Henrik Gilvad Bios).
	- Fixed no-sync with interrupts. (In LBA HDs reproduction was
	  faster than normal).
	- No sync in CHS HDs to improve the speed.

0.02b -> 0.03b:

	- Tested and fixed bugs in LBA HDs.
	- Fixed slow motion in Panasonic A1WX MSX2+ with 6 MHz.

0.01b -> 0.02b:

	- Beta version. It can have many bugs or not working.
	- HD must be defragmented.
	- Not implemented support for 12 fps EVAS yet.
	- Not tested LBA (>512MB) HDs.
	- In older and slower HDs... slow motion sure! and distorsions in
	  sound!
	- Player only support HDs. It doesn't support CD-ROMS and neither
	  ATAPI devices with direct access.

